OL,3,AStrabane withdraws from UK Town of
OL,4,ACulture bid due to 'great division'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA competition that is supposed to
OL,7,Fcelebrate local towns has been rejected
OL,8,Fby a council after it caused "great
OL,9,Fdivision" over its UK title.
OL,11,FThe mainly-nationalist town of Strabane
OL,12,Fin County Tyrone was shortlisted as one
OL,13,Fof 15 possible locations for the
OL,14,Finaugural UK Town of Culture 2028, with
OL,15,Fthe chance to win #3m.
OL,17,FHowever, the local council voted not to
OL,18,Fgo ahead with the bid on Wednesday with
OL,19,Fone councillor claiming it "has the
OL,20,Fpotential to be a disaster for Strabane
OL,21,F- for community relations".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
