OL,3,AStrabane withdraws from UK Town of
OL,4,ACulture bid due to 'great division'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe motion, which was put forward by
OL,7,Findependent councillors, was backed by
OL,8,Fthe Social Democratic and Labour Party
OL,9,F(SDLP) and Sinn Fein.
